{
  "name": "IIoT - Resumo diário de produção no WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Resumo diário de produção\n\nA plataforma chama este webhook quando um dia de produção fecha (turnos encerrados e a máquina parada há 30 min, hora extra incluída) — **uma mensagem por vez**, das 07h às 21h e com no mínimo 3 min entre envios. Quem acumula os fechamentos das 17h e dá o ritmo é a fila da plataforma; aqui só se envia: o texto e, em seguida, as imagens de produção e de paradas de cada equipamento.\n\n1. Preencha **Configuração**.\n2. Ative e copie a URL de produção do nó **Resumo recebido** para a variável **N8N_SUMMARY_WEBHOOK_URL** da plataforma (Coolify).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "56b80173-21b2-4009-a3a1-7437774c518f",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "everlenz-iiot-resumo",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0b9d1351-70bd-406e-aef1-539c6c21ca73",
      "name": "Resumo recebido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "df665823-92b3-4afe-a8a2-3946137d042a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "0d9cb0d7-9d35-42fc-8543-0c1dc2f62af2",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_URL",
              "value": "https://iotplataform.everlenz.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "45b73b6e-19cc-4e2d-b843-189a8023e271",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_CHAVE",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_N8N_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2e1dc174-471f-4319-9cc4-c9caa2831e35",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_URL",
              "value": "https://evolutionapi.assistentedrfin.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d3386a97-94f5-4f73-a099-5a01c412cd3e",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA",
              "value": "NOME_DA_INSTANCIA",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "80a883da-ba14-4fa4-8b52-da7611b61f99",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_APIKEY",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_APIKEY_DA_EVOLUTION",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5894623f-efe7-453a-a0df-2b6bd5960091",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "afa85ae8-97a0-4155-894a-e4dba31793ec",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.headers['x-n8n-key'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10ff3e96-af58-4fa2-95a8-def9df58f640",
      "name": "Chave válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "bbb4a1d3-76ff-4bf7-8670-80885d097c51",
      "name": "Ignora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.waitSeconds || 10 }}"
      },
      "id": "d76d160b-5fab-4acb-ae0a-adaeb9ef8eaa",
      "name": "Espera aleatória",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ String(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.url || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL) || '').replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/message/sendText/{{ encodeURIComponent(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.instance || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA)) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.apikey || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "delay",
              "value": "={{ 1500 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 2500) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "presence",
              "value": "composing"
            },
            {
              "name": "linkPreview",
              "value": "={{ false }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "8b82023e-ad5c-4625-80a7-8b266a0201b4",
      "name": "Envia resumo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "de8a4e11-a0d1-4e14-b0b3-8767108f2bb4",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.images || []).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0fddba32-35c8-4bcc-932a-28e2af628b37",
      "name": "Tem imagens?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Produção e paradas de cada equipamento, na ordem em que a plataforma mandou.\nreturn ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.images || []).map((image) => ({ json: image }));"
      },
      "id": "2e86b8df-283a-4cf1-aa9a-1453dede1fbc",
      "name": "Separa imagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4def1854-366e-4fdc-ae82-5195228ff833",
      "name": "Uma imagem por vez",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1560,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ 3 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 4) }}"
      },
      "id": "db3af6c8-f7b4-44b0-aa7a-79e2f6768796",
      "name": "Pausa entre imagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1780,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ String(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.url || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL) || '').replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/message/sendMedia/{{ encodeURIComponent(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.instance || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA)) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.apikey || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { number: $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number, mediatype: 'image', mimetype: $json.mimetype, caption: $json.caption, media: $json.base64, fileName: $json.fileName } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "d6274b4f-af3b-474a-b3a0-05a3697b542f",
      "name": "Envia imagem",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        -120
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: true } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "68265624-1cc6-45cd-b14c-c2e22e51eb2c",
      "name": "Confirma envio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        -320
      ],
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: false, error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.message ?? 'falha na Evolution').slice(0, 400) } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "57771bdd-9ad6-4bbf-a23f-ac764f0734b4",
      "name": "Registra falha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        120
      ],
      "executeOnce": true
    }
  ],
